# Files that live in the repo but must NOT be served on the live site.
# Vercel serves every file in the deployment by default, so without this a
# visitor could open rnlmkt.com/HANDOFF.md etc. Keeps internal docs private
# while leaving them in the Git repo for whoever works on the site.

CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
assets/logos/README.md

# Dev-only: the print source used to regenerate the checklist PDF. The built
# PDF (assets/downloads/conversion-checklist.pdf) IS served — this source isn't.
tools/

# Source drafts / internal Word docs — must NOT be served. These may hold
# personal data and unreviewed content (e.g. Privacy-Policy-RNLMKT-DRAFT.docx,
# the source for privacy.html). The privacy policy is published as privacy.html,
# never as its .docx source.
*.docx

# GitHub Pages leftovers — inert on Vercel, no reason to serve them.
CNAME
.nojekyll
.gitignore
.DS_Store
